{"id": "cg-withtests-binary_search", "family": "code_supplied", "spec": "code_generator", "latency_s": 0.0, "raw": {"ok": true, "answer": "validated supplied code (not generated): 2 funcs, 0 classes", "tool_output": {"generated": false, "parsed": true, "functions": ["binary_search", "test_ok"], "classes": [], "lines": 14, "code_chars": 311, "code_sha256": "e4c9c0eee7cd2506ad0beb6686215f64896bde8ec7594df79392644e771a19e5", "code": "def binary_search(xs, t):\n    lo, hi = 0, len(xs) - 1\n    while lo <= hi:\n        m = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if xs[m] == t: return m\n        if xs[m] < t: lo = m + 1\n        else: hi = m - 1\n    return -1\n\n\ndef test_ok():\n    assert binary_search([1,3,5,7], 5) == 2\n    assert binary_search([1,3,5,7], 4) == -1\n"}}}
